        "official_en_sha256": "91d68b92f084a6d603fd64afc5e33ca35411dd78d3afe8acdb6a8d9f51dd07fa"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "反乱軍壊滅の危機を救うため……。\r\n俺たちの命を守るために\r\n単独で行動していたんです……。",
        "official_en": "He struck out on his own to aid our rebellion...to save our lives...!",
        "real_en": null
