        "official_en_sha256": "1602a5c828014d02fd4476f935bf562a1f7a9b94fc61ecbd0d43e6b4ef69d842"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "帝国兵を返り討ちにしてやるつもりだが……。\r\nかなりの人数に追われている。\r\nまあ、生き残るのは難しいだろうな。",
        "official_en": "<text style=\"italic\">I’ll take down as many of those scoundrels as I can, but there’s just too many of them. I doubt I’ll make it out alive.</>",
